change                                 level      registry
add an optional field                  NONE       accepted
remove a field                         NONE       accepted
retype a field, keeping its number     NONE       accepted

add an optional field                  BACKWARD   accepted
remove a field                         BACKWARD   refused (409)
retype a field, keeping its number     BACKWARD   refused (409)

add an optional field                  FULL       accepted
remove a field                         FULL       accepted
retype a field, keeping its number     FULL       refused (409)


